  description: The simplest result of necromantic reanimation, Skeleton Minions possess
    little independent thought and retain few memories of their former existence.
    Individually weak, they are often raised in considerable numbers. Their creation
    represents one of the earliest and most infamous applications of Death-aligned
    Mana.
